    narr:narration """On 2026-08-23, DaveQuantum announced a decided migration of the analytics pipeline from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB, stated as a settled [decision](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1) and restated as a summary bullet [PostgreSQL → QuantumDB](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3). The rationale rests on two claims: a [10x query performance gain](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2) and lower licensing cost, the performance figure repeated as a [summary bullet](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4). A [timeline of Q3 2026](narr:Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5) is attached to the migration. All five children are voiced by DaveQuantum and carry `supports` predicates; the envelope contains no challenge, no dissent, and no counter-proposal. The performance and cost figures are asserted as claims (irrealis, future-oriented) rather than demonstrated with benchmarks or evidence. The migration is framed entirely in technical and matter-of-fact register, with no discussion of risk, migration method, data integrity, rollback, or operational impact.""" ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ;
    narr:covers <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "We're switching from PostgreSQL to QuantumDB for the analytics pipeline." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "10x query performance, lower licensing cost." ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Database migration**: PostgreSQL → QuantumDB" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Performance gain**: 10x analytical queries" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ] ;
    narr:keyPhrase [ narr:text "**Timeline**: Q3 2026" ; narr:phraseSource <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "All five children support the migration; no child challenges, qualifies, or raises risk — the envelope is unanimous and contains no dissenting voice." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_1> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_3> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_5> ] ;
    narr:variation [ narr:text "Performance and cost claims are asserted without benchmarks, evidence, or qualification — the 10x figure is stated as fact, not demonstrated." ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_2> ; narr:over <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Expr_1E2EQuantum1787476633158_4> ] ;
